/github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100434.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100434.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-20T02:11:18Z"},"body":"The functions are doing interpretation work, not just blind copying, so they should be renamed to reflect what they actually do.\r\n\r\nI chose the `parse_` prefix to match the existing `parse_utf8` and `parse_utf16`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b9437c393871c377b5ece131afaf831e78dfb6f8/core/string/ustring.h#L527-L531\r\n\r\nArguably, the interfaces should be made to match and the functions exposed to public, but this would be for another PR. In this one, I'm just trying to clear up semantics a bit, which should be uncontroversial.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100434/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}